---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getTopics } from '../../lib/topics';

const topics = await getTopics();
---

<BaseLayout title="Topics | Agentic Coding Trending">
  <section lang="en">
    <h1>Topics</h1>
    <p>GitHub repositories this knowledge base tracks. Signals come from each repository's releases and changelog.</p>
    <ul class="topics">
      {topics.map((t) => (
        <li>
          <a href={t.repoUrl}><strong>{t.repo}</strong></a>
          <p>{t.reason.en}</p>
          <p class="links">
            <a href={t.releasesUrl}>Releases</a>
            {t.changelogUrl && <> · <a href={t.changelogUrl}>Changelog</a></>}
            {t.tags.length > 0 && <span class="tags"> · {t.tags.join(', ')}</span>}
          </p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section lang="zh-Hant">
    <h1>追蹤主題</h1>
    <p>本知識庫所追蹤的 GitHub 儲存庫。觀察訊號來自各儲存庫的版本發布與變更紀錄。</p>
    <ul class="topics">
      {topics.map((t) => (
        <li>
          <a href={t.repoUrl}><strong>{t.repo}</strong></a>
          <p>{t.reason.zh}</p>
          <p class="links">
            <a href={t.releasesUrl}>版本發布</a>
            {t.changelogUrl && <> · <a href={t.changelogUrl}>變更紀錄</a></>}
            {t.tags.length > 0 && <span class="tags"> · {t.tags.join(', ')}</span>}
          </p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .topics { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .topics li { padding: .75rem 1rem; border: 1px solid #dce3ee; border-radius: .75rem; }
  .topics li + li { margin-top: .75rem; }
  .topics p { margin: .25rem 0 0; }
  .links, .tags { color: #52627a; font-size: .9rem; }
</style>
